<title>USA: Pioneering holds 10.1 pct Tencor stake.</title>
<headline>Pioneering holds 10.1 pct Tencor stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pioneering Management Corp said in a Securities and Exchange Commission filing Tuesday it holds a 10.1 percent stake in Tencor Instruments or 3,110,000 common shares.</p>
<p>Pioneering disclosed its latest position on Tencor in a 13G filing.</p>
<p>Filings under 13G are usually made by institutions and large investors with &quot;passive&quot; investment objectives in a company. Unlike 13D filings, those reports do not list the latest transactions.</p>
</text>
